{
    "flags": 0,
    "messages": [
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0000",
            "en_US": [
                "Welcome to the Union Room.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "If there is anything you need help\n",
                "with, please let me know! {VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0001",
            "en_US": ""
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0002",
            "en_US": [
                "Which topic would you\n",
                "like me to explain?"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0003",
            "en_US": [
                "There are five Battle Formats.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Single Battle is for two Trainers\n",
                "with one or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Each Trainer can have one Pokémon\n",
                "in battle at a time.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Double Battle is for two Trainers\n",
                "with two or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Each Trainer will send out two\n",
                "Pokémon to battle at a time.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Triple Battle is for two Trainers\n",
                "with three or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Each Trainer will send out three\n",
                "Pokémon to battle at a time.{VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0004",
            "en_US": [
                "Rotation Battle is for two Trainers\n",
                "with three or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Each Trainer sends out three Pokémon at\n",
                "a time, one in front and two in the back.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Multi Battle is for four Trainers\n",
                "with one or more Pokémon each.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Each Trainer can have one Pokémon\n",
                "in battle at a time.{VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0005",
            "en_US": [
                "You may trade your Pokémon with\n",
                "other players.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Meeting new people could be a\n",
                "shortcut to meeting rare Pokémon!{VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0006",
            "en_US": ""
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0007",
            "en_US": [
                "In a Spin Trade, participants each bring\n",
                "an Egg for trading with others.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Which Egg will you end up with?\n",
                "What kind of Pokémon is in that Egg?{VAR BE00}\n",
                "It's quite exciting and fun!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Up to five players can take part, so\n",
                "try it with your friends!{VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0008",
            "en_US": [
                "You may get together with others\n",
                "and draw a picture.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "You all get to work on one sheet\n",
                "of paper at the same time.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "I'm sure a drawing made by friends\n",
                "will be a memorable masterpiece!{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Up to five players can take part,\n",
                "so try it with your friends!{VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
        {
            "id": "a003_463_0009",
            "en_US": [
                "If you touch an icon on the bar\n",
                "on the Touch Screen below,{VAR BE00}\n",
                "you can choose words for chatting{VAR BE00}\n",
                "or tell others what you want to do,{VAR BE00}\n",
                "such as battles or trades.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Also, players who have chosen the same\n",
                "icon as you will jump up and down{VAR BE00}\n",
                "so you can spot them easily.{VAR BE01}\n",
                "Touch any icon to find a person you want\n",
                "to play with.{VAR BE01}"
            ],
            "flags": 224
        },
